    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>硬核拆解XXX背后的哲学原理</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">0:40</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;理解和把握xxx的概念，回避xxx陷阱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;澄清一些up主对xxx理解的误区</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;自由意志的真实情况：人的自由是有限的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">29:46</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;充分的自由与社会性的冲突，自由权利与物化的关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;通过社交关系上的不确定性建立不平等的恶性关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">46:43</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;一见钟情其实是最功利的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;半真半假的人作恶最难防</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3051">50:51</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;对摆脱精神控制给出的建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3318">55:18</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;xxx为什么会在我们这个时代出现</span></p><br><br><br>]]></description>
